    "name": "Countertop espresso machine assembly",
    "description": "Multi-solid STEP assembly representing a compact countertop espresso machine with rounded enclosure, open dispensing bay, control panel, brew group, operating lever, steam wand, removable panels, rear ventilation features, feet, and two cup accessories. STEP face matching is based on face geometry, bounding boxes, solid grouping, and correspondence with the rendered views. Inclusive range notation such as \"FACE 178 through FACE 394\" is used in minor_faces_Brep_id for compactness.",
