      "front",
      "back",
      "left",
      "right",
      "top",
      "bottom",
      "toprightiso"
    ],
    "symmetry_note": "The primary enclosure, dispensing opening, brew group, rear panels, and feet are approximately bilaterally symmetric about the machine center plane. The steam wand and some controls break this symmetry. The STEP file is an assembly of 56 solids rather than one monolithic part."
  },
